  <running_head>CASTIGATIO PARAL.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">video, quis tali argumento contradice-</l>
    <l n="2">re possset.</l>
    <l n="3" para="true">Tertiò, Calvinus <i>Athanasium, Basilium,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4">
      <i>Cyrillum veræ doctrinæ vindices appellavit.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5">Verè hic titulus ipsis competit. Vin-</l>
    <l n="6">dicavit enim Athanasius doctrinam de</l>
    <l n="7">persona Christi, veram &amp; orthodoxam</l>
    <l n="8">contra Arianos, Basilius contra Sabel-</l>
    <l n="9">lianos, &amp;c. Sed quomodo hæc omnia</l>
    <l n="10">applicat Jesuita? Ponit</l>
    <l n="11" para="true">[ornament]</l>
    <l n="12" type="heading" level="1" para="true">GENERALE ARGUMENTUM</l>
    <l n="13" type="heading" level="1">ad suffragia pro mortuis pro-</l>
    <l n="14" type="heading" level="1">banda. In forma tale.</l>
    <l n="15" para="true">
      <i>Quadringentis, quingentis à Christo</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16">
      <i>annis erat florens adhuc religio, vi-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17">
      <i>gens sincerior doctrina, nihil à principio</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>immutata, doctrina, inquam, vindicum ve-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19">
      <i>ritatis. Quadringentis &amp; quingentis illis an-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20">
      <i>nis homines orationibus, precibus, oblationi-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21">
      <i>bus vivorum juvabantur.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22" para="true">
      <i>Ergò</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>The opening initial Q of "Quadringentis" is a large woodcut initial. The ornamental dividers are printer's ornaments, not text. The word "Ergò" stands at the right margin, set apart as a closing word.</notes>
</page>
